section#logos(class='mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--main-container)] px-[15px]')
	div(class='mx-auto w-full max-w-[var(--container)]')
		hr(class='mb-8 border-0 border-t-2 border-[var(--storybook-divider)]')
		h2(class='mb-2 font-display text-[length:var(--h2-size)] leading-[length:var(--h2-line)] font-bold') Logos
		p(class='mb-8 text-[length:var(--p-size)] leading-[length:var(--p-line)] text-[var(--ageco-gray-dark)]')
			| Usar los archivos oficiales sin distorsión. Mantener área de respeto alrededor del logo.

		div(class='mb-10 grid gap-8 m:grid-cols-2')
			article(class='rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-soft)] bg-white p-6')
				h3(class='mb-4 font-display text-[length:var(--h3-size)] leading-[length:var(--h3-line)] font-semibold') Logo AGECO
				div(class='mb-4 flex items-center justify-center bg-[var(--ageco-gray)] p-10')
					div(class='border border-dashed border-[var(--sigo-green)] p-6')
						img(
							class='h-20 w-auto object-contain',
							src='./assets/ageco-logo.png',
							alt='Logo AGECO con área de respeto',
							width='182',
							height='120'
						)
				p(class='m-0 text-sm text-[var(--ageco-gray-dark)]')
					| El borde punteado simula el
					strong(class='mx-1') área de respeto
					| . No recortar ni estirar el logo.

			article(class='rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-soft)] bg-white p-6')
				h3(class='mb-4 font-display text-[length:var(--h3-size)] leading-[length:var(--h3-line)] font-semibold') Logo Sigo Vigente
				div(class='mb-4 flex items-center justify-center bg-[var(--ageco-gray)] p-10')
					img(
						class='h-16 w-auto object-contain',
						src='./assets/sigo-vigente-logo.svg',
						alt='Logo Sigo Vigente',
						width='200',
						height='60'
					)
				p(class='m-0 text-sm text-[var(--ageco-gray-dark)]')
					| Identifica el programa Sigo Vigente. En el CRM el header usa solo el logo AGECO.

		h3(class='mb-4 font-display text-[length:var(--h3-size)] leading-[length:var(--h3-line)] font-semibold') Usos correctos e incorrectos
		div(class='grid gap-4 m:grid-cols-2')
			div(class='rounded-md border border-[var(--sigo-green)] bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--sigo-green)_8%,white)] p-4')
				p(class='mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--sigo-green)]') Correcto
				ul(class='m-0 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-[var(--paragraph-color)]')
					li Proporción original (object-contain)
					li Fondo claro o con contraste suficiente
					li Espacio libre alrededor del logo
					li Logo AGECO en header y footer sin distorsión
			div(class='rounded-md border border-[var(--ageco-red)] bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--ageco-red)_8%,white)] p-4')
				p(class='mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--ageco-red)]') Incorrecto
				ul(class='m-0 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-[var(--paragraph-color)]')
					li Estirar o comprimir el logo
					li Aplicar sombras o efectos no autorizados
					li Colocar sobre fondos que reduzcan legibilidad
					li Recolorear fuera de la guía de marca
